    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast off into the infinite universe!<br>&quot;Rocket Penguin&quot; is a unique 2D flying game that may seem simple but requires master-level skills to reach outer space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/66361c9f535cafca5b9c78f450cbf18d.avif?t=1749881105\" data-has-big /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an orphan bird that cannot fly, the penguin protagonist Peeo has always envied those who can soar freely through the sky. One day, by a twist of fate, he acquires a unique rocket engine and, henceforth, embarks on a bizarre adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/2b9a4a6eca297f61b72087ccc0e56317.avif?t=1749881105\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/66d27a6c12e3f3f1db71ef8698c7b006.avif?t=1749881105\" data-has-big /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quirky rocket flight \u2013 just two buttons, and it actually works!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless altitude expedition mode: strive to break through the atmosphere, challenge the world rankings, or test your limits!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every crash brings you closer to mastering the art of flight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ story levels filled with unique challenges, from eating contests and speed races to cargo delivery and even soccer matches!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your look and upgrade your rocket!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet penguins of all shapes and sizes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local split-screen PvP \u2013 battle your friends or crash into chaos together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/7887524c0b38fbd3cf8b7033c4f04634.poster.avif?t=1749881105\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/7887524c0b38fbd3cf8b7033c4f04634.webm?t=1749881105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/7887524c0b38fbd3cf8b7033c4f04634.mp4?t=1749881105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/fd75a724a0d9ab380e26a8fda39157e3.poster.avif?t=1749881105\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/fd75a724a0d9ab380e26a8fda39157e3.webm?t=1749881105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/fd75a724a0d9ab380e26a8fda39157e3.mp4?t=1749881105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect all the rockets!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rocket comes with unique specs and abilities, with over 10 different rockets to pilot! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/fb38593e50af39cea65316855dd0f909.poster.avif?t=1749881105\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/fb38593e50af39cea65316855dd0f909.webm?t=1749881105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/fb38593e50af39cea65316855dd0f909.mp4?t=1749881105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Meet the penguins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you'll meet a variety of penguins. Who will be your trusty ally, and who will try to sabotage you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/c5fedc8b5db2ff3bf64cc45ec8672eaf.poster.avif?t=1749881105\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/c5fedc8b5db2ff3bf64cc45ec8672eaf.webm?t=1749881105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/56db29f0dd2f20dc204841419379ac2d.avif?t=1749881105\" data-has-big /></span><strong><i>&quot;A bizarre rocket adventure \u2014 can you blast off to the universe?&quot;</i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast off into the infinite universe!<br>&quot;Rocket Penguin&quot; is a unique 2D flying game that may seem simple but requires master-level skills to reach outer space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/66361c9f535cafca5b9c78f450cbf18d.avif?t=1749881105\" data-has-big /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an orphan bird that cannot fly, the penguin protagonist Peeo has always envied those who can soar freely through the sky. One day, by a twist of fate, he acquires a unique rocket engine and, henceforth, embarks on a bizarre adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/2b9a4a6eca297f61b72087ccc0e56317.avif?t=1749881105\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/66d27a6c12e3f3f1db71ef8698c7b006.avif?t=1749881105\" data-has-big /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quirky rocket flight \u2013 just two buttons, and it actually works!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless altitude expedition mode: strive to break through the atmosphere, challenge the world rankings, or test your limits!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every crash brings you closer to mastering the art of flight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ story levels filled with unique challenges, from eating contests and speed races to cargo delivery and even soccer matches!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your look and upgrade your rocket!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet penguins of all shapes and sizes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local split-screen PvP \u2013 battle your friends or crash into chaos together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/7887524c0b38fbd3cf8b7033c4f04634.poster.avif?t=1749881105\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/7887524c0b38fbd3cf8b7033c4f04634.webm?t=1749881105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/7887524c0b38fbd3cf8b7033c4f04634.mp4?t=1749881105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/fd75a724a0d9ab380e26a8fda39157e3.poster.avif?t=1749881105\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/fd75a724a0d9ab380e26a8fda39157e3.webm?t=1749881105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/fd75a724a0d9ab380e26a8fda39157e3.mp4?t=1749881105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect all the rockets!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rocket comes with unique specs and abilities, with over 10 different rockets to pilot! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/fb38593e50af39cea65316855dd0f909.poster.avif?t=1749881105\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/fb38593e50af39cea65316855dd